{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel like a cannonball with guns, knocking the crap out of your enemies! No one can stand in your way!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SHOOT \u2014 SMASH \u2014 RAM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A simple and proven formula.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844800/extras/7675085635c15a1842eec5be9388ec34.poster.avif?t=1774437810\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844800/extras/7675085635c15a1842eec5be9388ec34.webm?t=1774437810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844800/extras/7675085635c15a1842eec5be9388ec34.mp4?t=1774437810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot badass guns with unusual alt-fire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash your enemies with a chain anvil and knock ammo out of them like a pi\u00f1ata.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ram forward with a fast anvil dash that pierces enemies and restores your health.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNIQUE ENEMIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Original design, unique behavior.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844800/extras/8971c44d3f85d5bb042b0069a6570951.avif?t=1774437810\" width=1560 height=429 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>They\u2019ll make you feel fear \u2014 and the urge to tear them apart.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844800/extras/1edf569973b992eaf402d703153a0873.avif?t=1774437810\" width=1560 height=429 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Enemy behavior won\u2019t let you stand still, making every fight feel different.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ATMOSPHERE &amp; VISUALS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hand-painted dieselpunk at your fingertips.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844800/extras/8451e99d4d71f1fa02ba41533ece874d.avif?t=1774437810\" width=1560 height=429 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fight among brutal, gigantic buildings, endless factories, and monumental palaces.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844800/extras/3ab24615b76c655df14a5a68458f81a7.avif?t=1774437810\" width=1560 height=429 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The atmosphere will amaze and crush you, while hand-crafted textures please the eye.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DYNAMIC MOVEMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Float like a butterfly, drop like an anvil.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844800/extras/976b31f8ec75aa04e6b683c6f83717e7.poster.avif?t=1774437810\" width=1280 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844800/extras/976b31f8ec75aa04e6b683c6f83717e7.webm?t=1774437810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844800/extras/976b31f8ec75aa04e6b683c6f83717e7.mp4?t=1774437810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our game is in the early stages of active development. Currently, we're focused on the game's foundation and refining its core mechanics. However, we regularly share updates on our progress. Follow us on social media!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udca5 Add BLEEDING to your wishlist to stay up to date with the first gameplay demos, support the studio, and be the first to hear development news!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3844800?t=1774437810","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3844800?t=1774437810","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844800/6daa2033b87afd62d27f4d651a699c732b48e482/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774437810","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844800/6daa2033b87afd62d27f4d651a699c732b48e482/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774437810","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel like a cannonball with guns, knocking the crap out of your enemies! No one can stand in your way!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SHOOT \u2014 SMASH \u2014 RAM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A simple and proven formula.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844800/extras/7675085635c15a1842eec5be9388ec34.poster.avif?t=1774437810\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844800/extras/7675085635c15a1842eec5be9388ec34.webm?t=1774437810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared